<metadata><name>Sea to Sea Dossier</name><desc>Sea to Sea (Yam el Yam), Achziv to the Kinneret, 16-19 October 2026. Route from OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL).</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="33.04379" lon="35.10070"><ele>4</ele><name>NIGHT 0 · Thu 15 Oct · Achziv: INPA campsite in Achziv National Park, paid, showers, no dogs; free alternative the eucalyptus grove behind the Yad LeYad memorial 800 m north</name><type>Night</type><extensions><osmand:color>#C8322B</osmand:color><osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon><osmand:background>circle</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="33.04296" lon="35.28684"><ele>544</ele><name>NIGHT 1 · Fri 16 Oct · Abirim: free night camp with a tap and a bin at the village entrance, no toilets, 546 m</name><type>Night</type><extensions><osmand:color>#C8322B</osmand:color><osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon><osmand:background>circle</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="33.00910" lon="35.39375"><ele>885</ele><name>NIGHT 2 · Sat 17 Oct · Horbat Hammama: INPA free night camp, tap, toilets, fires in the marked spots, 886 m, cold nights</name><type>Night</type><extensions><osmand:color>#C8322B</osmand:color><osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon><osmand:background>circle</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="32.97314" lon="35.46253"><ele>606</ele><name>NIGHT 3 · Sun 18 Oct · Nahal Amud night camp: INPA paid camp at the upper reserve entrance, book online, check-in 15:00-19:00, taps, toilets, 530 m</name><type>Night</type><extensions><osmand:color>#C8322B</osmand:color><osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon><osmand:background>circle</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="32.97905" lon="35.44236"><ele>655</ele><name>NIGHT 3 option B · Pitul Meron: free night camp with tables and a tap by road 866, 2.6 km before the reserve gate</name><type>Night</type><extensions><osmand:color>#C8322B</osmand:color><osmand:icon>tourism_camp_site</osmand:icon><osmand:background>circle</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="32.85484" lon="35.53224"><ele>-210</ele><name>FINISH · Mon 19 Oct · Ginosar, Kinneret shore: -211 m, bus 59 from the Ginosar stop on road 90</name><type>Flag</type><extensions><osmand:color>#C8322B</osmand:color><osmand:icon>special_flag_finish</osmand:icon><osmand:background>circle</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="32.99778" lon="35.41373"><ele>1198</ele><name>PASS · Har Meron 1204 m - highest point of the trail; the line crosses the summit plateau, the peak loop is 15 min off it; tap at the summit car park</name><type>Summit</type><extensions><osmand:color>#6B7775</osmand:color><osmand:icon>natural_peak</osmand:icon><osmand:background>octagon</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="33.06874" lon="35.10570"><ele>1</ele><name>INFO · Betzet beach - free camping alternative north of the national park, no facilities</name><type>Info</type><extensions><osmand:color>#B3701C</osmand:color><osmand:icon>special_information</osmand:icon><osmand:background>square</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="33.05089" lon="35.10398"><ele>6</ele><name>INFO · Yad LeYad memorial - tap at the entrance; eucalyptus grove behind it used by Sea to Sea hikers</name><type>Info</type><extensions><osmand:color>#B3701C</osmand:color><osmand:icon>special_information</osmand:icon><osmand:background>square</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="33.04440" lon="35.22656"><ele>284</ele><name>INFO · Montfort castle - Crusader ruin above the stream; steps and a short scramble up, do not sleep here (reserve)</name><type>Info</type><extensions><osmand:color>#B3701C</osmand:color><osmand:icon>special_information</osmand:icon><osmand:background>square</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="33.04145" lon="35.25009"><ele>251</ele><name>INFO · Ein Tamir - spring in a long cut tunnel; headtorch, waist-deep water at the end; last reliable stream water before the climb to Abirim</name><type>Info</type><extensions><osmand:color>#B3701C</osmand:color><osmand:icon>special_information</osmand:icon><osmand:background>square</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="33.01075" lon="35.38984"><ele>920</ele><name>INFO · Har Meron field school - paid camp with kitchen, showers and toilets, 250 m from Horbat Hammama</name><type>Info</type><extensions><osmand:color>#B3701C</osmand:color><osmand:icon>special_information</osmand:icon><osmand:background>square</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="32.96984" lon="35.47519"><ele>434</ele><name>INFO · Sechvi pools - upper Nahal Amud canyon: ladders, pins and handholds for 6 km; exit the reserve trails by 16:00; no drinking from the stream</name><type>Info</type><extensions><osmand:color>#B3701C</osmand:color><osmand:icon>special_information</osmand:icon><osmand:background>square</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
<wpt lat="32.95030" lon="35.48096"><ele>468</ele><name>INFO · Ein Koves - spring by the middle section; reports say not a usable camp, no tap</name><type>Info</type><extensions><osmand:color>#B3701C</osmand:color><osmand:icon>special_information</osmand:icon><osmand:background>square</osmand:background></extensions></wpt>
